#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/usb.md:10
msgid "USB packets, activation and explicit roles"
msgstr "USB 包、激活与显式角色"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/usb.md:12
msgid ""
"Device packets, Host pipes and explicitly managed OTG roles have distinct "
"identities. The selected controller, PHY, power and endpoint profile must be"
" admitted before a ready face can be used."
msgstr ""
"Device 数据包、Host pipe 及显式管理的 OTG 角色具有独立身份。使用就绪接口前，必须对选定控制器、PHY、电源及端点配置完成准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/usb.md:16
msgid ""
"USB Device and Host use distinct packet faces. An explicitly managed OTG "
"role owns the selected core/PHY and exposes the ready face for its current "
"generation. The [USB ownership contract](../../contracts/io/usb-"
"lifecycle.md) defines PHY speeds, PIO or HS AHB DMA, power handover and "
"optional ST Core bridges."
msgstr ""
"USB Device 和 Host 使用独立的 packet face。显式 managed OTG 角色拥有选定 core／PHY，并为当前 "
"generation 提供 ready face。[USB 所有权合同](../../contracts/io/usb-lifecycle.md)定义 "
"PHY 速度、PIO 或 HS AHB DMA、供电交接及可选 ST Core 桥接。"

