msgstr "显式激活或反激活一个已选定的非零 endpoint 方向。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/usb.md:25
msgid ""
"No request or buffer is borrowed. Existing loans must be explicitly "
"cancelled and drained before target changes; failure never revokes other "
"loans. Configuration/class policy remains external."
msgstr ""
"不借用任何 request 或 buffer。目标变更之前，必须显式取消并排空该目标的既有借用；失败从不撤销其他借用。配置／类策略仍由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/usb.md:0
